  "title": "Shunt reactor delivery 12-13.07.26",
  "summary": "The project will reduce the visual impact of the overhead electricity line across the Dwyryd Estuary between Minffordd and Llandecwyn in Eryri National Park by removing 10 pylons and 3km of overhead line and replacing them with electricity cables buried in a tunnel deep underground. Shunt reactors are an essential part of a high voltage energy transmission system.",
